 | ----- |\\n| **Storage** (R-A1..A5, R-F8, R-G1) | Universal Links Access, `.lino` codec + `LinoTextStore`, binary `DoubletsStore`, `DualStore` with `verify()`, backup/prune/restore, encrypted backups. | `tests/storage.test.js`, `tests/backup.test.js` |\\n| **Sources** (R-E1..E9) | `MessageSource` framework + nine adapters (telegram, vk, x, whatsapp, facebook, linkedin, habr-career, hh, superjob); `importInto(store, source, archive)`. | `tests/sources.test.js` |\\n| **Patterns** (R-C1, R-C2) | `inferRegex`, `simplifyRegex`, `matchAll`, LCS synthesis, `compilePeg`. | `tests/patterns.test.js` |\\n| **Replies** (R-C2) | Sørensen-Dice similarity, candidate finder, reply-variation groups, `pickVariation`. | `tests/patterns.test.js` |\\n| **Automation** (R-C3, R-C4) | Graph runtime with pattern → reply → send chains in auto / semi-auto modes. | `tests/automation.test.js` |\\n| **CRM + facts** (R-C5, R-D1..D4) | Contact aggregation, set algebra, fact extraction. | `tests/crm.test.js` |\\n| **Sync** (R-F5) | Vector-clock CRDT, peer abstraction with echo-suppression, in-process loopback + TCP transport. | `tests/sync.test.js`, `tests/sync-tcp.test.js` |\\n| **Broadcast** (R-B4, R-D5, R-D6) | Cross-network broadcast, profile sync, resume sync. | covered via sources/server tests |\\n| **CLI** (R-A2, R-A4) | `bin/meta-sovereign.js` + `src/cli/`: full HTTP-API parity. | `tests/cli.test.js`, `tests/cli-iter3.test.js` |\\n| **Server** (R-F8) | Node `http`: `/links`, `/sources`, `/api/contacts`, `/api/patterns`, `/api/patterns/infer`, `/api/graphs`, `/api/graphs/run`, `/api/replies`, `/api/profile`, `/api/resume`, `/api/broadcast`, `/api/audience`, `/api/facts`, `/api/search`, `/api/autocomplete`, `/api/status`. | `tests/server.test.js`, `tests/server-iter3.test.js`, `tests/e2e.test.js`, `tests/browser-commander.test.js` |\\n| **Web UI** (R-F1) | `src/web/`: SPA. | covered via `tests/server.test.js` and browser-commander e2e |\\n| **Electron** (R-F1, R-F3) | `electron/main.js` opens the local server URL. | manual smoke |\\n| **Docker** (R-F6, R-F7) | `docker/web.Dockerfile`, `docker/rtc.Dockerfile`, `docker/docker-compose.yml`. | manual smoke |\\n| **Rust port** (R-G2) | `Cargo.toml` workspace + `crates/meta-sovereign-core/` with vector-clock CRDT, MemoryStore, LinoTextStore. | `cargo test` |\\n\\n## Quality gates\\n\\n- `node --test` → **61/61 JS tests pass**.\\n- `cargo test` → **7/7 Rust tests pass**.\\n- `npm run lint` → 0 errors, 0 warnings.\\n- `npm run format:check` → clean.\\n- `npm run check:duplication` → clean.\\n- `.changeset/issue-1.md` is a single combined entry covering all three iterations.\\n\\n## Test plan\\n\\n- [x] `npm test` (61/61 pass).\\n- [x] `cargo test --manifest-path crates/meta-sovereign-core/Cargo.toml` (7/7 pass).\\n- [x] `npm run check` (lint + format:check + duplication) clean.\\n- [x] CLI smoke: every iteration-3 subcommand covered by `tests/cli-iter3.test.js`.\\n- [x] Server + SPA smoke covered by `tests/server.test.js`, `tests/server-iter3.test.js`, `tests/browser-commander.test.js`.\\n- [x] End-to-end pipeline covered by `tests/e2e.test.js`.\\n- [x] Backup round-trip (plain + encrypted) covered by `tests/backup.test.js`.\\n- [x] Sync loopback + vector-clock merge covered by `tests/sync.test.js`; TCP transport by `tests/sync-tcp.test.js`.\\n- [x] All commits on `issue-1-fc41adad29ce`.\\n\\nRefs: #1\\n\\nFixes #1\",\"mergeable\":\"MERGEABLE\",\"number\":2,\"state\":\"OPEN\",\"statusCheckRollup\":[{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-05-01T11:56:46Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-sovereign/actions/runs/25213430700/job/73928594498\",\"name\":\"Check Links\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-05-01T11:56:38Z\",\"status\":\"COMPLETED\",\"workflowName\":\"Broken Link Checker\"},{\"__typename\":\"CheckRun\",\"completedAt\":\"2026-05-01T11:56:44Z\",\"conclusion\":\"SUCCESS\",\"detailsUrl\":\"https://github.com/link-foundation/meta-sovereign/actions/runs/25213